vesktop (1.6.8-1nano) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream release
    - Updated Electron to address the recent eMudhra certificate authority
      security issue which undermines trust in affected certificates.
      This does not mean Vesktop was compromised, but updating is strongly
      recommended.
    - Fixed various issues related to screenshare with system audio on Linux
    - Improved the Native titlebar setting
    - Fixed not being able to zoom with Numpad +/-
    - Fixed various titlebar issues

 -- Christopher Roy Bratusek <nano@jpberlin.de>  Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:57:57 +0200

